Text:The Satanic Olympics The opening of the 2024 Olympic Games in Paris is the final judgment on modern Western civilization. The West is cursed, and this is axiomatic. Anyone who does not immediately take up arms to destroy this Satanic civilization, unprecedented in its brazenness, is complicit with it. But another aspect is also important. On that pole, there is the West and its unabashed woke Satanism. And on our pole, what do we have? Something slightly more decent, the penultimate stop, but on the same path, the same route. We slammed on the brakes sharply when the destination loomed ahead, where the giant figure of the Pale Rider, surrounded by a retinue of liberal perverts and body-positive monstrosities, stood. But we are still drifting there by inertia and certainly do not question the previous stage of our history — are we even on the right train if the final station on the route is the French Olympics 2024? The West is the devil. And who are we? On the one hand, it horrifies us, and it throws us out of its unholy banquet, but on the other hand, it is still inside us; we have not completely expelled it from ourselves; the devil rages and rampages in our culture, having been allowed in not decades but centuries ago. The West (and thus the devil) began systematically penetrating Russia in the 17th century. Slavophiles in the 19th century recognized it and raised the alarm. This had an effect but did not prevent further decline. And now we are really starting to brake only now. This will succeed only if God is with us. Nothing else will work. For this, Russia must be God’s; we must become His people, His followers, true Russian Christians. We can only pray and fight. Fight with prayer and pray as if before death, for the last time. The Special Military Operation is a war against Satan, against the West, against the Olympic Games, where the rebellious Titans of Tartarus have displaced the gods and taken their places. Occidens delenda est.. Answer:

